</div></nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Tiling & renovations - Sydney NSW</p>
    <h1>Precise tiling,<br>renovations that<br><span class="acc">hold.</span><br><span class="thin">Floor & wall · Bathrooms · Kitchens · Waterproofing</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A1 Sydney Build PTY LTD - floor & wall tiling, bathroom & kitchen renovations, waterproofing, screeding & levelling across Sydney. ABN 33 672 885 657.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#lbq">Get a free quote</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong>Floor & wall</strong>Porcelain, ceramic, stone</p>
      <p><strong>Wet areas</strong>Waterproofing certified</p>
      <p><strong>Sydney metro</strong>Inner west to northern beaches</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Tiling services.</h2><p class="lead">Every tile cut, laid and grouted to a flat, lippage-free finish - wet areas, floors, walls and feature surfaces.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><h3>Floor & wall tiling</h3><p>Porcelain, ceramic, natural stone and large-format - substrate prep, layout, setting out and grout to spec.</p></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><h3>Bathroom tiling</h3><p>Full wet-area tiling - floors, walls, niches, benches and hobless showers with certified waterproofing underneath.</p></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><h3>Kitchen tiling</h3><p>Splashbacks, floors and feature walls - precise cuts around outlets, joinery and stone benchtops.</p></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><h3>Waterproofing</h3><p>Internal wet-area membranes to AS 3740 - bathrooms, laundries, balconies and planter boxes.</p></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">05</span><h3>Screeding & levelling</h3><p>Cement-based screeds and self-levelling compounds - flat, sound substrates for any tile format.</p></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">06</span><h3>Repairs & regrouting</h3><p>Cracked tiles, loose drums, failed grout and leaking showers - targeted repairs without full rip-out where possible.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="renovations"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Renovations.</h2><p class="lead">Bathroom and kitchen renovations managed end-to-end - strip-out, waterproofing, tiling, joinery coordination and final fit-off.</p></div></div>
  <div class="renov-grid">
    <div class="renov rv">
      <h3>Bathroom renovations</h3>
      <p>Complete bathroom rebuilds - demolition, waterproofing, tiling, plumbing coordination, vanity and fixture install, final seal.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Hobless showers & linear drains</li>
        <li>Wall-hung vanities & in-wall cisterns</li>
        <li>Heated towel rails & under-tile heating</li>
        <li>Frameless screens & niche detailing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="renov rv">
      <h3>Kitchen renovations</h3>
      <p>Kitchen strip-out to fit-off - splashback tiling, floor prep & tiling, benchtop coordination, joinery liaison, appliance integration.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Stone, glass & tile splashbacks</li>
        <li>Large-format floor tiling to kickboards</li>
        <li>Subfloor prep for timber, hybrid & tile</li>
        <li>Plumbing & electrical coordination</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="rooms"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">What we do - room by room.</h2><p class="lead">The same substrate discipline and tile craft applied across every wet area and tiled floor in the home.</p></div></div>
  <div class="room-grid">
    <div class="room rv"><span class="room-n">01</span><h3>Main bathroom</h3><p>Floor-to-ceiling tiling, hobless shower, niche, bench, vanity splash - waterproofed, laid flat, epoxy grout option.</p></div>
    <div class="room rv"><span class="room-n">02</span><h3>Ensuite</h3><p>Compact wet-area efficiency - large-format walls, minimal grout lines, linear drain, wall-hung vanity tiling.</p></div>
    <div class="room rv"><span class="room-n">03</span><h3>Powder room</h3><p>Feature wall tiling, floor continuity, vanity splash - high impact in a small footprint.</p></div>
    <div class="room rv"><span class="room-n">04</span><h3>Kitchen</h3><p>Splashback tiling to rangehood, floor tiling to kickboards, benchtop upstand coordination.</p></div>
    <div class="room rv"><span class="room-n">05</span><h3>Laundry</h3><p>Floor & skirt tiling, trough splash, waterproofing to floor waste - practical, hard-wearing finishes.</p></div>
    <div class="room rv"><span class="room-n">06</span><h3>Balcony & alfresco</h3><p>External-rated porcelain, fall-correct screeds, balcony waterproofing membranes, expansion joints.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="sydney" class="sydney-band"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">04</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Sydney - where we work.</h2><p class="lead">Based in Sydney and working across the metro - inner west, north shore, northern beaches, eastern suburbs, CBD fringe and south-west corridors.</p></div></div>
  <div class="sydney-grid">
    <div class="sydney-item rv"><div class="sydney-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Inner West</h3><p>Leichhardt, Marrickville, Balmain, Annandale, Petersham, Dulwich Hill</p></div>
    <div class="sydney-item rv"><div class="sydney-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>North Shore</h3><p>Chatswood, North Sydney, Lane Cove, Willoughby, Mosman, Neutral Bay</p></div>
    <div class="sydney-item rv"><div class="sydney-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Northern Beaches</h3><p>Manly, Dee Why, Mona Vale, Avalon, Brookvale, Narrabeen</p></div>
    <div class="sydney-item rv"><div class="sydney-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Eastern Suburbs</h3><p>Bondi, Coogee, Randwick, Kensington, Double Bay, Paddington</p></div>
    <div class="sydney-item rv"><div class="sydney-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>CBD & Fringe</h3><p>Pyrmont, Ultimo, Surry Hills, Redfern, Alexandria, Zetland</p></div>
    <div class="sydney-item rv"><div class="sydney-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>South West</h3><p>Liverpool, Campbelltown, Camden, Oran Park, Gregory Hills</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">05</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Questions we hear.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you handle waterproofing certification?</summary><div class="faq-a">Yes - internal wet-area membranes to AS 3740. Certificate provided on completion for bathrooms, laundries, balconies and planter boxes.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Can you match existing tiles for a repair?</summary><div class="faq-a">We source closest-match tiles where possible. If an exact match is unavailable we discuss options - feature band, contrast border, or full re-tile of the affected plane.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>What tile formats do you work with?</summary><div class="faq-a">Porcelain, ceramic, natural stone, large-format (up to 1200x2400), mosaic sheets, terrazzo-look and textured external-rated porcelain.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you coordinate other trades for renovations?</summary><div class="faq-a">Yes - we manage plumbing, electrical, carpentry and joinery coordination for bathroom and kitchen renovations so the program runs in sequence.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>How long does a bathroom renovation take?</summary><div class="faq-a">Typically 2–3 weeks from strip-out to final clean for a standard main bathroom. Complex layouts, custom joins or supply lead times can extend this - we confirm the program in the quote.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you provide written quotes?</summary><div class="faq-a">Always - a detailed scope and firm price before any work starts. No day-rate surprises.</div></details>
</div></section>

<section class="stat-band" id="stats"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="stat rv d1"><b>5</b><span>Core services</span></div>
  <div class="stat rv d2"><b>2</b><span>Renovation types</span></div>
  <div class="stat rv d3"><b>6</b><span>Room categories</span></div>
  <div class="stat rv d4"><b>6</b><span>Sydney zones</span></div>
</div></section><span id="lbq" style="position:absolute;top:-90px" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<section id="lbq" aria-labelledby="lbq-h">
<style>
#lbq{--lbq-accent:var(--acc);--lbq-ink:var(--ink);--lbq-muted:var(--ink-2);--lbq-bg:var(--bg-2);--lbq-panel:var(--panel);--lbq-line:var(--line);padding:72px 20px;background:var(--lbq-bg);color:var(--lbq-ink)}
#lbq *{box-sizing:border-box}
#lbq .lbq-w{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:900px){#lbq .lbq-w{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
#lbq h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-family:var(--disp)}
#lbq p.lbq-s{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--lbq-muted);max-width:52ch}
#lbq .lbq-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--lbq-line);padding-top:22px}
#lbq .lbq-info div{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
#lbq .lbq-info b{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lbq-accent);min-width:64px}
#lbq .lbq-info a{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}
#lbq .lbq-f{display:grid;gap:12px;background:var(--lbq-panel);border:1px solid var(--lbq-line);border-radius:14px;padding:26px}
#lbq label{display:block;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lbq-muted);margin-bottom:5px}
#lbq input,#lbq textarea,#lbq select{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--lbq-line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:.95rem}
#lbq textarea{min-height:96px;resize:vertical}
#lbq input:focus,#lbq textarea:focus,#lbq select:focus{outline:2px solid var(--lbq-accent);outline-offset:1px;border-color:transparent}
#lbq button{margin-top:6px;padding:13px 22px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--lbq-accent);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:.95rem;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.02em}
#lbq button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait}
#lbq .lbq-st{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--lbq-muted);min-height:1.2em}
#lbq .lbq-cons{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--lbq-muted);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
#lbq .lbq-cons input{width:auto}
#lbq .lbq-hp{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}
</style>
<div class="lbq-w">
  <div>
    <h2 id="lbq-h">Get a free quote</h2>
    <p class="lbq-s">Tell us about the job and we'll come back with a firm price - no surprises, no obligation.</p>
    <div class="lbq-info">
      <div><b>Area</b><span>Sydney metro NSW</span></div>
      <div><b>ABN</b><span>33 672 885 657</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <form id="lbq-form" novalidate data-site="a1-sydney-build" data-biz="A1 Sydney Build">
    <div class="lbq-f">
      <div class="lbq-g">
        <div><label for="lbq-n">Name</label><input id="lbq-n" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div><label for="lbq-p">Phone</label><input id="lbq-p" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></div>
        <div><label for="lbq-e">Email</label><input id="lbq-e" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email"></div>
        <div class="lbq-full"><label for="lbq-svc">Service</label>
          <select id="lbq-svc" name="service"><option>Floor & wall tiling</option><option>Bathroom renovation</option><option>Kitchen renovation</option><option>Waterproofing</option><option>Screeding & levelling</option><option>Repairs & regrouting</option><option>Other</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="lbq-full"><label for="lbq-m">Tell us about the job</label><textarea id="lbq-m" name="message" placeholder="Room, tile type, approx m², timing…" required></textarea></div>
      </div>
      <label class="lbq-cons"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="1" checked> I agree to be contacted about this request.</label>
      <div class="lbq-hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
      <button type="submit">Send quote request</button>
      <p class="lbq-st" id="lbq-st" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </form>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var EP = null;
  function base(cb){
    if (window.__LAYDBACK_API_BASE) return cb(window.__LAYDBACK_API_BASE);
    var done = false;
    var t = setTimeout(function(){ if(!done){done=true;cb('https://grocery-periodically-everyone-wine.trycloudflare.com');} }, 2500);
    fetch('https://gist.githubusercontent.com/laydbackapps-beep/48ff985c786b72a1637d7875f4df79b8/raw/api-base.txt?_=' + Date.now())
      .then(function(r){ return r.text(); })
      .then(function(txt){
        var b = (txt||'').trim().replace(/\/+$/, '');
        if (done) return;
        done = true; clearTimeout(t);
        cb(/^https:\/\/[a-z0-9.\-]+(:\d+)?$/i.test(b) ? b : 'https://grocery-periodically-everyone-wine.trycloudflare.com');
      })
      .catch(function(){ if(!done){done=true;clearTimeout(t);cb('https://grocery-periodically-everyone-wine.trycloudflare.com');} });
  }
  function init(){
    var f = document.getElementById('lbq-form');
    if (!f) return;
    var st = document.getElementById('lbq-st');
    var btn = f.querySelector('button[type=submit]');
    f.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      var d = {};
      new FormData(f).forEach(function(v,k){ d[k]=v; });
      if (d.website) return;
      if (!d.name || (!d.phone && !d.email) || !(d.message||'').trim()) {
        st.textContent = 'Please add your name, a phone or email, and a few words about the job.';
        st.style.color = '#ff9d8a';
        return;
      }
      btn.disabled = true;
      st.textContent = 'Sending…';
      st.style.color = '';
      base(function(B){
        var url = B + '/functions/v1/quote-request';
        fetch(url, {
          method:'POST',
          headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},
          body: JSON.stringify({
            site_id: f.dataset.site || '',
            business_name: f.dataset.biz || '',
            name: d.name, phone: d.phone, email: d.email,
            service: d.service || '', message: d.message,
            consent: !!d.consent
          })
        })
        .then(function(r){ return r.json().catch(function(){ return {}; }); })
        .then(function(x){
          if (x && x.success) {
            f.reset();
            st.textContent = "Thanks - your request is in. We'll be in touch shortly.";
            st.style.color = 'var(--lbq-accent)';
          } else {
            throw new Error((x && x.error) || 'Could not send');
          }
        })
        .catch(function(err){
          st.textContent = (err && err.message) ? err.message : 'Could not send - please try again or call.';
          st.style.color = '#ff9d8a';
        })
        .finally(function(){ btn.disabled = false; });
      });
    });
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
  else init();
})();
</script>
</section>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  <div>
    <div class="fbrand"><span class="b-txt"><span class="fbrand-name">A1 Sydney Build</span><br><span class="fbrand-sub">Tiling · Renovations · Waterproofing</span></span></div>
    <p style="margin-top:16px;font-size:.85rem;max-width:300px;color:var(--ink-2);">Floor & wall tiling · Bathroom & kitchen renovations · Waterproofing · Screeding & levelling - Sydney NSW.</p>
  </div>
  <div><h4>Services</h4><a href="#services">Floor & wall tiling</a><a href="#services">Bathroom renovations</a><a href="#services">Kitchen renovations</a><a href="#services">Waterproofing</a><a href="#services">Screeding & levelling</a></div>
  <div><h4>Company</h4><a href="#renovations">Renovations</a><a href="#rooms">Room by room</a><a href="#sydney">Sydney areas</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></div>
  <div><h4>Contact</h4><a href="#lbq">Request a quote</a><span style="color:var(--ink-2);padding:4px 0;display:block;font-size:.88rem">ABN 33 672 885 657</span></div>
</div>
<div class="footer-bar mono">
  <span>&copy; <span id="year"></span> A1 SYDNEY BUILD PTY LTD · </span>
  <a href="#lbq">Get a quote</a>
</div>
</footer>


<script>
/* ---- page glue (reveal + nav) preserved through the scene retrofit ---- */
(function(){var rvs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.rv'));
if('IntersectionObserver' in window){var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(en){
if(en.isIntersecting){en.target.classList.add('on');io.unobserve(en.target);}});},{rootMargin:'0px 0px -12% 0px',threshold:0.08});
rvs.forEach(function(el){io.observe(el);});}else{rvs.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('on');});}
setTimeout(function(){document.querySelectorAll('.rv:not(.on)').forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('on');});},1200);
var b=document.getElementById('burger'),n=document.getElementById('navlinks');
if(b&&n){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var o=n.classList.toggle('open');b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',o?'true':'false');});
n.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target.tagName==='A')n.classList.remove('open');});}
var y=document.getElementById('year');if(y)y.textContent=new Date().getFullYear();})();
</script>


